hbJdGRZmFd2c81cZcwcgy7tST45djT5vyLmWSqfwbAhbUrMDxvXo2qhgKXo9dhZxaILRfgYn-m2ypICtqoRfB-c5kx", "https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcS90zPVomInD_awqZ03ex3WvU_C2RJultaYqLhhxfEyBc0GWMjBPkbx1NAHKIjqxWgjWPq23POhs7xB8gCjGKiXRachwmlBag", "https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSyL9sGGv4SCemASxn3UWvndLV2VF-c7E3cs24y2La33s5bnY4nq1kKr6GjXdqR3C6PdylMvzma7PizYQAjel0nLR8_0k5HOw", "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcS5qDpHDcOeXnUZbpkxuCUSPexOmi4jlD54GluTDrhEkTTtPXa58sQaexypCEdyA_4GeFt11Vy1y0shn_GAkkJNegRUUABR", "https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSYMnmtJ63BcRl0-4g-jN9oYpnEi0ZV9qMhyo8F92Viz3BDMpRaVYhCtMDErxhdp7DilbjZUlz5D8L6Si_HyYAdT5bFGPm_", "https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRxb8YysOtuLipZJHYuhyObR9VfZWxYtsOCQ3LdnUNDS7aU9kVJy4d5jvhsn1srGTz_KX_p-I01cFjP2Rs5btdRc2XuRkdQiQ", "https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcR3wCl2WskcXaVHXyrC4CACHoa8e-CGvZd4A91_K4P1xIDBTtJ007UsM8EyQlwPat5Q7e67yzRhRr1thkaia53_IbuSj5zj", "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQBRX0O3W2H66OwETZvo3-mzuzGegamIg1bHYddnF6j-a0h-bHJCcnHyJg3QZIapFuCT0gBReSkT7DEmgBK8pWW-a6ccHHJcA"], "user_reviews": [{"title": "Met and exceeded expectations", "text": "I wanted headphones that sounded great, would let me listen to audiobooks in a noisy environment, and were wireless so I wasn’t constantly annoyed by wires while doing chores. These do all that. Plus it holds a charge a lot longer than expected, it’s far easier to set up and use than any Bluetooth device I’ve owned to date, and can take a phone call on it easily - all I have to do is select the name of the device from the list and it works. And it’s comfortable enough to wear for hours at a time.\n\nI don’t know if music listening on it meets audiophile standards but I’m not one and am pleased. I am a bass fan and it has enough. I can tell that the clarity of what I hear is much better than what I’m used to (earpods that come with iPhone) because I’m hearing sounds in music and podcasts I didn’t pick up on before.\n\nI downloaded the app and my model isn’t listed in the app software at first but that turned out not to matter. Once it was paired, it showed up.\n\nThis product is a home run for what I wanted it for. Great job!", "user_name": "Carolyn", "source": "walmart.com", "rating": 5, "date": "5 months ago", "icon": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/shsm/AGYqVK2heC_9pJfyJA1WwvB6uXGzTlnBRvFL8yahbvYhfFF_-BvRFLEIIiXBTjJNYCqslJJRjQ=w40-h40-c0x00000000-cc"}, {"title": "Love the super long battery life & quick charging", "text": "I can honestly say that these are best headphones I have ever owned…and my two teens agree with me and say they have “aura”. 😂 I found these one sale, so bought a pair for myself, and also for both of my boys for Christmas. I knew I was taking a gamble for the kids, since they are patircular about these types of things, but they both loved them. We got 2 black pairs and one blue pair.\n\nHere’s what I loved:\nSuper easy to setup and holds a charge for SO long. They are not joking about that part! I wear these things all the time and have only charged them once.\nSpeaking of charging…they charge super fast as well!!\nThe sound is great, and my kids like that they can go on the app and EQ the headphones to their liking. They are super comfortable to wear for long periods of time, and feel a lot more comfortable and lighter on my head that other headphones have in the past. They have some nice features, while still being super easy to use.\nEveryone in our family loves these; and that in itself is a miracle! They are worth every penny.\nIf you’re looking for a good protective case for them; I found a slim one on Amazon that works perfectly and was only $8. Just search for “Ginsco Ultra-Slim case” and it should have the JBL 520BT in the listening to let you know you’ve found the right one.", "user_name": "JenRod", "source": "JBL", "rating": 5, "date": "8 months ago", "icon": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/shsm/AGYqVK0BpD6Bcl-3q6rauNM-SKpGTDksMG7nb_-4pu17yf2mMaU2zoBQ1Sj21-KLuU2ohhlpUw=w40-h40-c0x00000000-cc", "images": ["https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSXMB50nS9RInQHFwPfWVo4C5kBcCI1ELqvd-xfJwMnoB7xu-fh1VNYuix5QnHVZVp_-xCFd4Rzy_tPn6u3ETjilhJ46muFcg", "https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRwa6z5DcMzxu9EXQ_rMm6r2C8zjVNDuXhO4t0HJXH9aQxoDoqO3c7fMkXnB00qZ6Nx5KC_mGC7jLvGPD7zMmP7npfzqDYoKQ", "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQHcv5zLNp_5Fdd_QBl5PQ9wd-8s5Ef0uO94EgkpmqaCdjAJnwiLsHLSoRBALt77cpsPYdeL1YSNa2oaxTf2DWi56UWba-TMA"]}, {"title": "Love the super long battery life & quick charging", "text": "I can honestly say that these are best headphones I have ever owned…and my two teens agree with me and say they have “aura”. 😂 I found these one sale, so bought a pair for myself, and also for both of my boys for Christmas. I knew I was taking a gamble for the kids, since they are patircular about these types of things, but they both loved them. We got 2 black pairs and one blue pair.\n\nHere’s what I loved:\nSuper easy to setup and holds a charge for SO long. They are not joking about that part! I wear these things all the time and have only charged them once.\nSpeaking of charging…they charge super fast as well!!\nThe sound is great, and my kids like that they can go on the app and EQ the headphones to their liking. They are super comfortable to wear for long periods of time, and feel a lot more comfortable and lighter on my head that other headphones have in the past. They have some nice features, while still being super easy to use.\nEveryone in our family loves these; and that in itself is a miracle! They are worth every penny.\nIf you’re looking for a good protective case for them; I found a slim one on Amazon that works perfectly and was only $8. Just search for “Ginsco Ultra-Slim case” and it should have the JBL 520BT in the listening to let you know you’ve found the right one.", "user_name": "JenRod", "source": "JBL", "rating": 5, "date": "8 months ago", "icon": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/shsm/AGYqVK0BpD6Bcl-3q6rauNM-SKpGTDksMG7nb_-4pu17yf2mMaU2zoBQ1Sj21-KLuU2ohhlpUw=w40-h40-c0x00000000-cc", "images": ["https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSXMB50nS9RInQHFwPfWVo4C5kBcCI1ELqvd-xfJwMnoB7xu-fh1VNYuix5QnHVZVp_-xCFd4Rzy_tPn6u3ETjilhJ46muFcg", "https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRwa6z5DcMzxu9EXQ_rMm6r2C8zjVNDuXhO4t0HJXH9aQxoDoqO3c7fMkXnB00qZ6Nx5KC_mGC7jLvGPD7zMmP7npfzqDYoKQ", "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQHcv5zLNp_5Fdd_QBl5PQ9wd-8s5Ef0uO94EgkpmqaCdjAJnwiLsHLSoRBALt77cpsPYdeL1YSNa2oaxTf2DWi56UWba-TMA"]}, {"title": "Exceeds Expectations", "text": "I'm very satisfied with my JBL headphones. They exceed my expectations, allows me to talk on the phone freeing up my hands to cook, clean, or work. The sound exceeds my expectations. I can watch my shows/videos on my phone without waking my husband up. The charge seems to last forever and the charge time takes only minutes to fully charge. The bud covers fit my ears perfectly. They feel snug at the very beginning of use but then adjusts and is very comfortable. The head band has a nice cushiony feel to it. They block external noise but not so much that I don't know when my husband is wanting my attention. I bought 2 for my husband and me. I identify mine with a rubber band. 😊 Great product and I highly recommend!", "user_name": "Anna", "source": "walmart.com", "rating": 5, "date": "8 months ago", "icon": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/shsm/AGYqVK12W-svN1W0CkMok8urmETXESgeAqSRgXv89Jrb9wxE1qMGbufHXERnCPF_sk2gnNzR5w=w40-h40-c0x00000000-cc", "images": ["https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcT3jAeKosihyYfvJCnN-w6u9uoblVdEiRdUpTIrLinPa4swQAIU3HlBonMbAnXJipWzXnTTnRyPD9lGAM8wJ6h5F0iv0tOD", "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQ3DchbJdGRZmFd2c81cZcwcgy7tST45djT5vyLmWSqfwbAhbUrMDxvXo2qhgKXo9dhZxaILRfgYn-m2ypICtqoRfB-c5kx", "https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcS90zPVomInD_awqZ03ex3WvU_C2RJultaYqLhhxfEyBc0GWMjBPkbx1NAHKIjqxWgjWPq23POhs7xB8gCjGKiXRachwmlBag", "https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSyL9sGGv4SCemASxn3UWvndLV2VF-c7E3cs24y2La33s5bnY4nq1kKr6GjXdqR3C6PdylMvzma7PizYQAjel0nLR8_0k5HOw"]}, {"title": "Pretty bad experience", "text": "I bought these headphones a while ago. I'm a mechanic and I wear them around the shop and to help block sound a little bit. But to be honest, I'm really really really disappointed in these headphones. I do understand these are more affordable and budget-friendly headphones and JBL makes good products. But honestly these have been some of the worst headphones I've ever had. They barely have the ability to stay on your head. I cannot wear these and take a sip of a bottle of water without them Just sliding right off whether I'm looking down or any other simple movement. These headphones don't seem to have the ability to actually stay on my head. It has become very frustrating to try to use these. I still continue to use them on a daily basis. But if you have the money buy something a little better than these, I apologize. JBL but these headphones are not good. Besides that, love your products", "user_name": "Oneazzy", "source": "JBL", "rating": 1, "date": "8 months ago", "icon": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/shsm/AGYqVK3Z90GSmbnHzGeooGtxFBEixJo4_LriDxqhSm9zqvmyufNsi12GMOEVlZPmOE1zlXS4Fg=w40-h40-c0x00000000-cc", "images": ["https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcS5qDpHDcOeXnUZbpkxuCUSPexOmi4jlD54GluTDrhEkTTtPXa58sQaexypCEdyA_4GeFt11Vy1y0shn_GAkkJNegRUUABR"]}, {"title": "My Favorite Headphones", "text": "best pair of headphones I've had yet. you can customize sound settings through your phone, they come with your name shows up when you connect via Bluetooth, can even locate them if you lose them. I love the color, fit, and sound! not to mention the best part which is the insane b